<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>Pricing - AnyAPI</title><meta name="description" content="Explore AnyAPI pricing plans — from a free tier to pro subscriptions. Get full access to powerful REST APIs for data validation, automation, and workflow integration."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://anyapi.io/pricing"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="AnyAPI"/><meta property="og:title" content="Pricing - AnyAPI"/><meta property="og:url" content="https://anyapi.io/pricing"/><meta property="og:description" content="Explore AnyAPI pricing plans — from a free tier to pro subscriptions. Get full access to powerful REST APIs for data validation, automation, and workflow integration."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://anyapi.io/cover.jpg"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="AnyAPI"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="twitter:domain" content="anyapi.io"/><meta property="twitter:url" content="https://anyapi.io/pricing"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://anyapi.io/cover.jpg"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Pricing - AnyAPI"/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Pricing - AnyAPI"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Explore AnyAPI pricing plans — from a free tier to pro subscriptions. Get full access to powerful REST APIs for data validation, automation, and workflow integration."/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:site" content="@anyapi_io"/><meta name="twitter:creator" content="@anyapi_io"/><link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png"/><meta name="msapplication-TileColor" content="#da532c"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff"/><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://anyapi.io/pricing","description":"Explore AnyAPI pricing plans — from a free tier to pro subscriptions. Get full access to powerful REST APIs for data validation, automation, and workflow integration."}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the different pricing plans available?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We offer a variety of pricing plans to fit the needs of different types of users. Our plans range from a free tier for small usage to larger, more comprehensive plans for heavy users."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a free trial or a free tier?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we offer a free tier that allows you to try out AnyAPI with a limited number of API calls. This is a great way to get a feel for our service and see if it meets your needs before committing to a paid plan!"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I upgrade or downgrade my plan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can easily upgrade or downgrade your plan at any time from your account settings. Simply select the new plan that you would like to switch to, and your billing will be adjusted accordingly."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I pay annually or do I have to pay monthly?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can choose to pay either monthly or annually, whichever is most convenient for you. If you choose to pay annually, you will receive a 30% discount on your total cost."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a discount for paying annually?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! we offer a 30% discounted rate for users who choose to pay annually. This can be a cost-effective option if you plan on using AnyAPI for an extended period of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a limit to the number of API calls I can make?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, the number of API calls that you are allowed to make is limited based on your pricing plan. Our Business plan support unlimited API calls."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer volume discounts for large usage?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we offer volume discounts for users who need a high volume of API calls. Contact us team to discuss your specific usage needs and we will work with you to create a customized plan that meets your needs at a discounted rate."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a money-back guarantee if I'm not satisfied with the service?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We offer a 14-days money-back guarantee for our paid plans. Contact us in under 14 days of your purchase to get a full refund."}}]}</script><meta name="next-head-count" content="30"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/css/50f8fe69c207e22a.css" as="style"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/50f8fe69c207e22a.css" data-n-g=""/><noscript data-n-css=""></noscript><script defer="" nomodule="" src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js"></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-10e8b529566fbebc.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/framework-94bfe357858f15f4.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-7c2d5bcff8a9c4dd.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/pages/_app-6cce63d9ade91708.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/363-244cbf7cabcda630.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/535-062291f42dc4ece4.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/675-41b9c55670353354.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/760-616231a01b3d7c01.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/167-5e12acaa9b2660fa.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/615-9f0e9a11545eb2bc.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/