cus:z-10 sm:w-auto sm:px-8">Yearly (Save 30%)</button></div></div><div class="mt-12 space-y-4 sm:mt-16 sm:space-y-0 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-1 sm:gap-6 lg:max-w-4xl lg:mx-auto xl:max-w-none xl:mx-0 xl:grid-cols-4"><div class="border rounded-lg shadow-md divide-y divide-gray-200 border-gray-400"><div class="p-6 relative"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-6 font-medium text-gray-900">Hobby</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500">Start building completely free</p><p class="mt-8"><span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">$0</span> <span class="text-base font-medium text-gray-500">/mo</span></p><div class="pt-5 pb-2"><ul role="list" class="space-y-4"><li class="flex space-x-3"><span class="text-sm text-gray-600"><b>300</b> <!-- -->requests/month</span></li><li class="flex space-x-3"><span class="text-sm text-gray-600"><b>1</b> <!-- -->requests/second</span></li></ul></div><button type="button" class="mt-8 block w-full bg-blue-600 border border-blue-500 rounded-md py-2 font-semibold text-white text-center hover:bg-blue-700">Get Started</button></div><div class="pt-6 pb-8 px-6"><ul role="list" class="space-y-4"><li class="flex space-x-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="flex-shrink-0 h-5 w-5 text-green-500"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 1 0 0-16 8 8 0 0 0 0 16Zm3.857-9.809a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.882l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span class="text-sm text-gray-600">SSL</span></li><li class="flex space-x-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="flex-shrink-0 h-5 w-5 text-green-500"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 1 0 0-16 8 8 0 0 0 0 16Zm3.857-9.809a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.882l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span